<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CIDCO downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CIDCO downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it downgraded CIDCO Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- On Wednesday the company said it expected to report a slight net profit and a small operating loss for the fourth quarter as its expenses rose and its gross margin fell.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 4-5/8 to 13-1/4 in early trading.</p>
</text>
